cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Hybrid Recursive Ladder: Query Planning for Bucket-Limited Time-Series APIs"
abstract: >-
  A query-planning method for long-range time-series aggregation over APIs with
  a hard per-request bucket limit. The range is decomposed into complete
  calendar units; each maximal contiguous run sharing a fetch level is fetched
  once at the next finer aggregation and folded locally; optional coverage
  tracking fetches only uncovered sub-ranges. The method is a composition of
  calendar mixed-radix decomposition, canonical interval decomposition, roll-up
  and multi-resolution aggregation.
